# Family tree visualization

See `AGENTS.md` (Family Tree Visualization). This feature lives under `frontend/src/app/features/home/`.

## Stack

- **Cytoscape** with **cytoscape-dagre** for layout.
- Do not add alternate graph engines (D3 force, vis.js, etc.) unless the user explicitly asks.

## Performance

- Avoid tearing down and recreating the Cytoscape instance unnecessarily; prefer updating elements and re-running layout when the codebase already does.

## Where to mirror patterns

- Graph building / styles: `frontend/src/app/features/home/graph/family-graph-elements.ts`, `family-graph-cytoscape-style.ts`
- Integration: `frontend/src/app/features/home/home.component.ts`
- Export helpers: `frontend/src/app/features/home/services/family-graph-export.service.ts`
